              "module_id": "mod-core",
              "file_path": "knowledge/modules/rag-engine-and-scoped-chat/diagrams.md",
              "title": "Atlas de 6 Diagramas del Módulo: RAG Engine Híbrido (RRF k=60) & Scoped Chat (Zero-RAG Bypass)",
              "summary": "```mermaid",
              "shelf": "modules",
              "content_markdown": "# 6 Diagramas Técnicos del Módulo `rag-engine-and-scoped-chat`\r\n\r\n## 1. Diagrama de Componentes (C3)\r\n```mermaid\r\nflowchart TD\r\n  apiRag[\"rag_api & chat_router\"] --> hAsk[\"AskRagQueryHandler\"]\r\n  apiRag --> sScoped[\"ScopedChatService\"]\r\n  hAsk --> sHybrid[\"HybridSearchService (RRF k=60)\"]\r\n  sHybrid --> dbChroma[(\"ChromaDB cf_project_{slug}\")]\r\n  sHybrid --> idxBm25[(\"BM25Plus\")]\r\n  sScoped --> cliLlm[[\"ILLMClient Activo\"]]\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 2. Diagrama de Clases UML\r\n```mermaid\r\nclassDiagram\r\n  class HybridSearchService {\r\n    +search(query, project_slug, top_k) List~RetrievalResult~\r\n  }\r\n  class ScopedChatService {\r\n    +int BYPASS_LIMIT\r\n    +answer_question(library_id, book_id, raw_markdown, query) dict\r\n  }\r\n  ScopedChatService --> HybridSearchService : \"usa en docs >32k\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 3. Diagrama de Secuencia Transaccional\r\n```mermaid\r\nsequenceDiagram\r\n  autonumber\r\n  actor Dev as \"Desarrollador\"\r\n  participant SSE as \"/chat/stream\"\r\n  participant Hybrid as \"HybridSearchService\"\r\n  participant LLM as \"ILLMClient\"\r\n  Dev->>SSE: \"Pregunta técnica\"\r\n  SSE->>Hybrid: \"search(q, project_slug)\"\r\n  Hybrid-->>SSE: \"Top chunks + citas\"\r\n  SSE-->>Dev: \"event: citations\"\r\n  SSE->>LLM: \"stream_chat()\"\r\n  LLM-->>Dev: \"event: token ... event: done\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 4. Diagrama de Máquina de Estados\r\n```mermaid\r\nstateDiagram-v2\r\n  [*] --> Retrieving : \"Consulta recibida\"\r\n  Retrieving --> CitationsSent : \"Chunks RRF listos\"\r\n  CitationsSent --> Streaming : \"Tokens LLM activos\"\r\n  Streaming --> Completed : \"event: done\"\r\n  Completed --> [*]\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 5. Diagrama de Actividades\r\n```mermaid\r\nflowchart TD\r\n  aIn([\"Scoped Query\"]) --> aSize{\"len(md) <= 32000?\"}\r\n  aSize -->|\"Sí\"| aFull[\"Zero-RAG Bypass: inyectar completo\"]\r\n  aSize -->|\"No\"| aVec[\"Chroma search_scoped(book_id)\"]\r\n  aFull --> aGen[\"ILLMClient.generate()\"]\r\n  aVec --> aGen\r\n  aGen --> aOut([\"Respuesta + Fuentes\"])\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 6. Sub-ERD del Módulo\r\n```mermaid\r\nerDiagram\r\n  CHAT_SESSIONS ||--o{ CHAT_MESSAGES : \"session_id\"\r\n  CHAT_SESSIONS {\r\n    varchar session_id PK\r\n    varchar book_id\r\n    varchar library_id\r\n  }\r\n  CHAT_MESSAGES {\r\n    varchar id PK\r\n    varchar session_id\r\n    varchar role\r\n    text sources_json\r\n  }\r\n```\r\n",
              "access": 0,
              "is_locked": 0,
              "is_favorite": 0,
              "archived_at": null,
              "view_props": "{\"full_width\":true,\"assets\":[{\"id\":\"asset-mermaid-1\",\"type\":\"mermaid\",\"diagram_type\":\"flowchart\",\"title\":\"Diagrama Mermaid #1 (flowchart)\",\"preview\":\"flowchart TD\"},{\"id\":\"asset-mermaid-2\",\"type\":\"mermaid\",\"diagram_type\":\"classDiagram\",\"title\":\"Diagrama Mermaid #2 (classDiagram)\",\"preview\":\"classDiagram\"},{\"id\":\"asset-mermaid-3\",\"type\":\"mermaid\",\"diagram_type\":\"sequenceDiagram\",\"title\":\"Diagrama Mermaid #3 (sequenceDiagram)\",\"preview\":\"sequenceDiagram\"},{\"id\":\"asset-mermaid-4\",\"type\":\"mermaid\",\"diagram_type\":\"stateDiagram-v2\",\"title\":\"Diagrama Mermaid #4 (stateDiagram-v2)\",\"preview\":\"stateDiagram-v2\"},{\"id\":\"asset-mermaid-5\",\"type\":\"mermaid\",\"diagram_type\":\"flowchart\",\"title\":\"Diagrama Mermaid #5 (flowchart)\",\"preview\":\"flowchart TD\"},{\"id\":\"asset-mermaid-6\",\"type\":\"mermaid\",\"diagram_type\":\"erDiagram\",\"title\":\"Diagrama Mermaid #6 (erDiagram)\",\"preview\":\"erDiagram\"}]}",
              "logo_props": "{\"in_use\":\"icon\",\"icon\":{\"name\":\"file-text\",\"color\":\"#6366f1\"}}",
