      "module_id": "mod-orchestrator",
      "file_path": "knowledge/modules/multi-llm-and-cli-orchestrator/diagrams.md",
      "title": "Atlas de 6 Diagramas del Módulo: Orquestador Multi-LLM Universal (15 Proveedores) & Agentes CLI",
      "summary": "```mermaid",
      "shelf": "modules",
      "content_markdown": "# 6 Diagramas Técnicos del Módulo `multi-llm-and-cli-orchestrator`\r\n\r\n## 1. Diagrama de Componentes (C3)\r\n```mermaid\r\nflowchart TD\r\n  apiLlm[\"llm_settings_api\"] --> hAct[\"ActivateLLMProviderHandler\"]\r\n  hAct --> repoLlm[\"SqlLLMConfigRepository\"]\r\n  repoLlm --> dbSql[(\"SQLite llm_configurations\")]\r\n  facLlm[\"LLMFactory (Strategy/Registry)\"] --> adpCli[\"CLIProcessClient (agy/claude)\"]\r\n  facLlm --> adpHttp[\"HTTP Clients (Ollama/Gemini/OpenAI/Anthropic)\"]\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 2. Diagrama de Clases UML\r\n```mermaid\r\nclassDiagram\r\n  class LLMFactory {\r\n    +create_client(config) ILLMClient\r\n    +test_embedding_connection(...) dict\r\n  }\r\n  class CLIProcessClient {\r\n    +string binary_name\r\n    +List~string~ base_args\r\n    +_build_command(prompt, system, model) List~string~\r\n  }\r\n  LLMFactory ..> CLIProcessClient : \"crea\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 3. Diagrama de Secuencia Transaccional\r\n```mermaid\r\nsequenceDiagram\r\n  autonumber\r\n  actor User as \"Usuario\"\r\n  participant UI as \"settings.html\"\r\n  participant API as \"/api/v1/settings/llm/activate\"\r\n  participant Repo as \"SqlLLMConfigRepo\"\r\n  User->>UI: \"Clic en Activar agy\"\r\n  UI->>API: \"POST /activate {provider: antigravity_cli}\"\r\n  API->>Repo: \"set_active_provider() + sync settings\"\r\n  Repo-->>UI: \"200 OK (persistido en SQLite y localStorage)\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 4. Diagrama de Máquina de Estados\r\n```mermaid\r\nstateDiagram-v2\r\n  [*] --> Inactive : \"Seed DEFAULT_CONFIGS\"\r\n  Inactive --> Tested : \"POST /test\"\r\n  Tested --> Active : \"POST /activate\"\r\n  Active --> Inactive : \"Otro proveedor activado\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 5. Diagrama de Actividades\r\n```mermaid\r\nflowchart TD\r\n  cStart([\"_build_command()\"]) --> cClean[\"Filtrar -p/--prompt/--print de base_args\"]\r\n  cClean --> cBin{\"bin_stem == agy?\"}\r\n  cBin -->|\"Sí\"| cAgy[\"Agregar --dangerously-skip-permissions + --model + -p={prompt}\"]\r\n  cBin -->|\"No\"| cOther[\"Agregar --model + -p + prompt\"]\r\n  cAgy --> cEnd([\"Lista segura sin shell=True\"])\r\n  cOther --> cEnd\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 6. Sub-ERD del Módulo\r\n```mermaid\r\nerDiagram\r\n  LLM_CONFIGURATIONS {\r\n    varchar provider PK\r\n    varchar engine_type\r\n    varchar default_model\r\n    varchar cli_command\r\n    varchar cli_args\r\n    boolean is_active\r\n  }\r\n  SETTINGS {\r\n    varchar id PK\r\n    varchar active_llm_model\r\n    varchar embedding_model\r\n    float temperature\r\n  }\r\n```\r\n",
      "access": 0,
      "is_locked": 0,
      "is_favorite": 0,
      "archived_at": null,
      "view_props": "{\"full_width\":true,\"assets\":[{\"id\":\"asset-mermaid-1\",\"type\":\"mermaid\",\"diagram_type\":\"flowchart\",\"title\":\"Diagrama Mermaid #1 (flowchart)\",\"preview\":\"flowchart TD\"},{\"id\":\"asset-mermaid-2\",\"type\":\"mermaid\",\"diagram_type\":\"classDiagram\",\"title\":\"Diagrama Mermaid #2 (classDiagram)\",\"preview\":\"classDiagram\"},{\"id\":\"asset-mermaid-3\",\"type\":\"mermaid\",\"diagram_type\":\"sequenceDiagram\",\"title\":\"Diagrama Mermaid #3 (sequenceDiagram)\",\"preview\":\"sequenceDiagram\"},{\"id\":\"asset-mermaid-4\",\"type\":\"mermaid\",\"diagram_type\":\"stateDiagram-v2\",\"title\":\"Diagrama Mermaid #4 (stateDiagram-v2)\",\"preview\":\"stateDiagram-v2\"},{\"id\":\"asset-mermaid-5\",\"type\":\"mermaid\",\"diagram_type\":\"flowchart\",\"title\":\"Diagrama Mermaid #5 (flowchart)\",\"preview\":\"flowchart TD\"},{\"id\":\"asset-mermaid-6\",\"type\":\"mermaid\",\"diagram_type\":\"erDiagram\",\"title\":\"Diagrama Mermaid #6 (erDiagram)\",\"preview\":\"erDiagram\"}]}",
