          "file_path": "knowledge/modules/knowledge-docs-and-registry/diagrams.md",
          "title": "Atlas de 6 Diagramas del Módulo: Knowledge Docs, Book Registry & Multiformat Extractors",
          "summary": "```mermaid",
          "shelf": "modules",
          "content_markdown": "# 6 Diagramas Técnicos del Módulo `knowledge-docs-and-registry`\r\n\r\n## 1. Diagrama de Componentes (C3)\r\n```mermaid\r\nflowchart TD\r\n  apiDocs[\"docs_api & registry_api\"] --> hIngest[\"IngestDocsCommandHandler\"]\r\n  apiDocs --> hBlocks[\"CreateBookFromBlocksHandler\"]\r\n  hIngest --> repoFs[\"LocalFilesystemRepository\"]\r\n  hIngest --> extMulti[[\"PDF/DOCX/XLSX Extractors\"]]\r\n  watcher[[\"BackgroundDocsWatcher (1.5s)\"]] --> hIngest\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 2. Diagrama de Clases UML\r\n```mermaid\r\nclassDiagram\r\n  class Document {\r\n    +string path\r\n    +string title\r\n    +string project_slug\r\n    +string content_markdown\r\n  }\r\n  class Attachment {\r\n    +string id\r\n    +string file_name\r\n    +string mime_type\r\n    +int size_bytes\r\n  }\r\n  Document \"1\" --> \"*\" Attachment : \"referencia\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 3. Diagrama de Secuencia Transaccional\r\n```mermaid\r\nsequenceDiagram\r\n  autonumber\r\n  actor Dev as \"Desarrollador\"\r\n  participant UI as \"Editor Dual\"\r\n  participant API as \"registry_api\"\r\n  participant FS as \"LocalFilesystemRepo\"\r\n  participant Idx as \"Chroma + BM25\"\r\n  Dev->>UI: \"Guarda documento y sube anexo\"\r\n  UI->>API: \"POST /api/v1/books/save\"\r\n  API->>FS: \"Escribe .md en ./docs/{slug}/\"\r\n  API->>Idx: \"Trocea e indexa chunks + anexos\"\r\n  Idx-->>UI: \"201 Created\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 4. Diagrama de Máquina de Estados\r\n```mermaid\r\nstateDiagram-v2\r\n  [*] --> Editing : \"Abrir Editor Dual\"\r\n  Editing --> Parsing : \"Alternar Markdown <-> Bloques\"\r\n  Parsing --> Saved : \"Persistir en ./docs/\"\r\n  Saved --> Indexed : \"Watchdog / IngestDocs\"\r\n  Indexed --> [*]\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 5. Diagrama de Actividades\r\n```mermaid\r\nflowchart TD\r\n  nStart([\"Subir Anexo\"]) --> nMime{\"Tipo MIME?\"}\r\n  nMime -->|\"PDF/DOCX/XLSX\"| nExtract[\"Extraer texto y tablas\"]\r\n  nMime -->|\"Audio/Imagen\"| nInline[\"Registrar recurso inline\"]\r\n  nExtract --> nIndex[\"Indexar en ChromaDB\"]\r\n  nInline --> nEnd([\"Card interactiva en visor\"])\r\n  nIndex --> nEnd\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 6. Sub-ERD del Módulo\r\n```mermaid\r\nerDiagram\r\n  BOOKS ||--o{ ATTACHMENTS : \"book_id\"\r\n  BOOKS {\r\n    varchar id PK\r\n    varchar library_slug\r\n    varchar path\r\n    varchar status\r\n  }\r\n  ATTACHMENTS {\r\n    varchar id PK\r\n    varchar book_id\r\n    varchar file_name\r\n    varchar mime_type\r\n  }\r\n```\r\n",
          "access": 0,
          "is_locked": 0,
          "is_favorite": 0,
          "archived_at": null,
          "view_props": "{\"full_width\":true,\"assets\":[{\"id\":\"asset-mermaid-1\",\"type\":\"mermaid\",\"diagram_type\":\"flowchart\",\"title\":\"Diagrama Mermaid #1 (flowchart)\",\"preview\":\"flowchart TD\"},{\"id\":\"asset-mermaid-2\",\"type\":\"mermaid\",\"diagram_type\":\"classDiagram\",\"title\":\"Diagrama Mermaid #2 (classDiagram)\",\"preview\":\"classDiagram\"},{\"id\":\"asset-mermaid-3\",\"type\":\"mermaid\",\"diagram_type\":\"sequenceDiagram\",\"title\":\"Diagrama Mermaid #3 (sequenceDiagram)\",\"preview\":\"sequenceDiagram\"},{\"id\":\"asset-mermaid-4\",\"type\":\"mermaid\",\"diagram_type\":\"stateDiagram-v2\",\"title\":\"Diagrama Mermaid #4 (stateDiagram-v2)\",\"preview\":\"stateDiagram-v2\"},{\"id\":\"asset-mermaid-5\",\"type\":\"mermaid\",\"diagram_type\":\"flowchart\",\"title\":\"Diagrama Mermaid #5 (flowchart)\",\"preview\":\"flowchart TD\"},{\"id\":\"asset-mermaid-6\",\"type\":\"mermaid\",\"diagram_type\":\"erDiagram\",\"title\":\"Diagrama Mermaid #6 (erDiagram)\",\"preview\":\"erDiagram\"}]}",
